# Build context for docker/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` before the root
# .dockerignore). The image only COPYs the workspace manifests, crates/ and the licence files, so everything else
# (target/, local data, secrets) stays out of the context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
# The licence and third-party notices the image ships under /usr/share/doc/memcore/.
!LICENSE
!licenses/
crates/**/target/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
